OL,3,APC Harper's killers to stay in jail as
OL,4,APM announces changes to early release
OL,5,Ascheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has told
OL,8,Fthe BBC that PC Andrew Harper's killers
OL,9,Fwill remain behind bars as he announced
OL,10,Fchanges to the early release scheme
OL,11,Faimed at easing prison overcrowding.
OL,13,FIn an exclusive interview with BBC
OL,14,FBreakfast, Burnham said anyone
OL,15,Fconvicted of unlawful killing,
OL,16,Fincluding all forms of manslaughter,
OL,17,Fwill be excluded from the scheme, which
OL,18,Fwould have made two of the officer's
OL,19,Fkillers eligible for early release.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
