OL,3,AManhunt after one killed and five
OL,4,Ainjured in Swiss shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has died and five people are
OL,7,Finjured after shots were fired at an
OL,8,Fevent in northern Switzerland
OL,9,Fovernight, local police say.
OL,11,F"The manhunt for the unknown
OL,12,Fperpetrator is under way," Aargau
OL,13,FCantonal Police said in a statement.
OL,14,F"Possible motives as well as the exact
OL,15,Fcircumstances of the crime are still
OL,16,Funclear."
OL,18,FThe force told Swiss media that the
OL,19,Fshooting took place near a horse racing
OL,20,Ftrack in Schachen, Aarau, some 46km (29
OL,21,Fmiles) west of Zurich.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
